      en: ["Founded in 1912 along the railway line.", "Hosts the National Cotton Festival annually.", "Thermal waters have high salt and mineral content.", "Contains a significant zoological and botanical garden.", "The National University of Chaco is headquartered here.", "Celebrations are held annually in honor of the immigrants.", "A major center for agricultural machinery manufacturing.", "The climate is subtropical with hot summers."],
