      en: ["Officially founded on January 5, 1901.", "Home to the Hito de las Tres Fronteras (Three Frontiers Landmark).", "The Iguazú National Park covers 67,720 hectares of protected land.", "The Tancredo Neves Bridge is 480 meters long.", "Hosts the Güira Oga bird rehabilitation and conservation center.", "Cataratas del Iguazú International Airport is among Argentina's busiest."],
