      en: ["Founded on February 4, 1898, by Colonel Celestino Pérez.", "The Chapelco ski resort reaches an elevation of 1,980 meters.", "Lake Lácar is one of the few Patagonian lakes that drains into the Pacific Ocean.", "Administrative headquarters of the Lanín National Park.", "The starting point of the 107 km long 'Road of the Seven Lakes'.", "The city maintains strict building codes to preserve its traditional alpine aesthetic."],
      es: ["Fundada el 4 de febrero de 1898.", "Unos 32.000 habitantes.", "Situada en el lago Lácar a 640 m de altitud.", "Puerta al Parque Nacional Lanín.", "Centro de esquí Cerro Chapelco.", "Arquitectura de estilo alpino.", "Influencia de inmigrantes alemanes y suizos.", "Rico patrimonio cultural mapuche."],
      pt: ["Fundada em 4 de fevereiro de 1898.", "Cerca de 32.000 habitantes.", "Localizada no Lago Lácar a 640 m de altitude.", "Porta de entrada para o Parque Nacional Lanín.", "Estância de esqui Cerro Chapelco.", "Arquitetura alpina.", "Influência de imigrantes alemães e suíços.", "Rico património cultural Mapuche."],
      fr: ["Fondée le 4 février 1898.", "Environ 32 000 habitants.", "Située au bord du lac Lácar à 640 m d'altitude.", "Porte du parc national Lanín.", "Station de ski Cerro Chapelco.", "Architecture de style alpin.", "Influence des immigrés allemands et suisses.", "Riche patrimoine culturel mapuche."],
